                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "This is the means by which clients obtain access tokens to use the service. You can see how to construct an Ably TokenRequest in the Ably TokenRequest spec documentation, although we recommend you use an Ably SDK rather to create a TokenRequest, as the construction of a TokenRequest is complex. The resulting token response object contains the token properties as defined in Ably TokenRequest spec. Authentication is not required if using a Signed TokenRequest."
